  "description": "AGSC-06-44 with AGSC-06-29: the licence URL of a node is bundle.license_url when configured (a URL that names a specific version of the licence), else the absolute URL of /legal/ when bundle.license_prose is the Content Use Terms identifier and the node emits /legal/, else none; every chunk carries it as license_url, and the license and terms members are unchanged. The member content_digest is present only when chunks.content_digest is true, and then holds the SHA-256 of the same bytes as digest in the RFC 9530 form sha-256=:<base64>: (RFC 9651 Byte Sequence); digest stays the bare lowercase hex and the two name the same hash. Four cases: a configured URL; the /legal/ URL; no URL (the node has another prose licence and no URL); and the content_digest switch on. Derived by hand with hashlib.",
